{"title":"The Ashen Templar","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">The Ashen Templar is a named <a href=\"#/monster/virikh-templar\">Virikh Templar</a> seen at level 53.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Where to find The Ashen Templar</h2>\n      \n      <ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Wind-Carved%20Rocks\">Wind-Carved Rocks</a></li></ul>\n      \n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"the-ashen-templar\">Show on map</button>\n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra\"><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"dragonhide-torso\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/c0c11b01db6e83ae53a8.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dragonhide Torso</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"stamina-potion-large\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/7fdf25f5efb0344b88a4.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Stamina Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div></div></div>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/f2cf6d115aa44596472c.webp\" alt=\"\"></div><h3>The Ashen Templar</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Kind</th><td><a href=\"#/monster/virikh-templar\">Virikh Templar</a></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>53</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>1,032</td></tr><tr><th>Seen</th><td>20 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}